Friendly employees who don't seem like they are ready to kill anyone despite dealing with the hordes of tourists who frequent the shop are a plus. Free refills on iced coffee and tea are what keep me coming back. Also: no wi-fi at this location."},{"business_id":"yHgRhWWUC1C8oQx8lChooA","review_id":"k2TmebY5W4knTDY8ryYtnw","date":"2011-01-06T03:25:34","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.8958777189254761,"text_excerpt":"This shop is connected to the hotel, but you can also walk in from the street. Excellent location near the riverfront/riverwalk. Spectacular almond hot chocolate. Great staff! Can't be beat."}],"visual":[]},"notebook_case":null}
